OL,3,GNEWSAHusband accused of GP murder
OL,4,Aappears at crown court
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe husband of a GP has appeared before
OL,7,Fa crown court charged with her murder,
OL,8,Fafter she was found dead at home.
OL,10,FThe body of 45-year-old Hannah Cain,
OL,11,Fknown to her patients as Dr Hannah
OL,12,FTerry, was found at a property in Fern
OL,13,FHill, Dersingham, Norfolk, on Sunday.
OL,15,FMark Cain, 45, also of Fern Hill, was
OL,16,Fcharged with murder on Tuesday.
OL,18,FAppearing via video link at King's Lynn
OL,19,FCrown Court, he spoke only to confirm
OL,20,Fthat he understood proceedings. He was
OL,21,Fremanded in custody until a plea
OL,22,Fhearing on 3 December.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
